    "enUS": {
      "description": "<The shattered remains of the orb lay at your feet. Delgren will want to see you have succeeded.>",
      "dialogue": {
        "80597c23c2e015601bb8": "This is a relief, $N. But whatever was watching Azeroth through that orb... I have a feeling they will not be happy it was destroyed.\n\nTake this as my thanks for your efforts. And... be careful.",
        "cbf2cd2adb7439065d15": "Did you find a way to destroy the orb?"
      },
      "summary": "Return the Orb Shards to Delgren.",
      "title": "Return to Delgren",
